# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code -- normally fine to commit, but 2026-10-28: a local launch.json may
# now carry the real FIELD_CATALOG_APP_KEY via --dart-define (see the field
# catalog share feature), so this folder is now git-ignored to keep that key
# out of version control. Re-comment this line if you'd rather keep .vscode/
# tracked and put the key somewhere else (a local, gitignored file instead).
.vscode/

